<title>USA: International buys Currituck. [CORRECTED 22:42 GMT]</title>
<headline>International buys Currituck. [CORRECTED 22:42 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>BILOXI, Miss. 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Custom Pack Inc said Tuesday it agreed to buy Currituck Crab Co.</p>
<p>(Corrects headline and text to clarify that International Custom Pack Inc is buying Currituck Crab Co, not selling a controlling interest in L.M. Sandler and Sons)</p>
</text>
